WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.750
Live questions let you ask the whole class one question and watch the answers arrive.

00:06.750 --> 00:08.441
First, the class timer.

00:08.891 --> 00:14.946
Pick a length from one minute to thirty, add a note like Silent reading if you like,

00:14.946 --> 00:21.360
and start the timer. Students see it at the top of their screen. It never locks anything.

00:21.810 --> 00:28.428
To ask a question, choose a unit under Ask from. Gradelings makes the question for you.

00:28.878 --> 00:35.194
As students answer, the bars fill, and each desk turns green for right or red for wrong.

00:35.194 --> 00:38.352
Students who haven't answered yet stay grey.

00:38.802 --> 00:46.334
Only you see the next question while the class works on this one. Choose a different question if you like.

00:46.334 --> 00:49.390
Then show the answer, or tap Next question.

00:49.840 --> 00:56.079
Everything from live questions is deleted after a day, and it never changes anyone's levels.

00:56.079 --> 01:00.080
Look back at today's questions to see who to check in with.
